WEBVTT

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.590
Most impressive, demon.
You are quite resilient.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.390
Quickly now, reveal your hideous,
demonic true form to the people.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.880
Screw... you!

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.000
Nui...

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:41.130
How long must I wait
before you come for me?

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.190
If I tear out my heart
and offer it to you,

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.530
will I be able to see you then?

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:28.110
The Approaching Demon

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:28.150
Unbelievable!

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.170
What are you doing at this hour?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:36.240
This is a nice wine.
Why don't you join me?

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:37.670
I'll pass.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:40.380
You truly aren't cordial, are you?

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.330
Although I love that about you.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:47.180
The foxes will get worried
if you drink too much.

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:50.190
Got a problem?

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:54.470
No, but when I think about
how before long I won't

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.630
get to hear your roundabout expressions of concern...

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.600
What do you mean by that?

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.450
Are you really leaving with them?

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:06.940
Are you lonely?

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:07.740
Yep!

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:10.530
Even though you have the foxes?

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:11.390
Yep!

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:13.410
Do you want me to stay?

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.200
Yep!

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:18.170
I can't keep company
with a blathering drunk.

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.040
Really, now.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.600
You should hold that kind
of conversation with

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.550
someone far cuter, not me.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:26.840
No.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.480
I want to with you.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:35.270
Even if you are sassy, violent
and not the least bit cute,

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:40.490
I enjoy myself the most
when I am with you, Hamaji.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:44.520
Honestly! You are such a smooth talker.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:02.370
Shino, the bath is open.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:07.000
I wanted to shampoo your hair!

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.730
No, thank you.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:13.050
At the very least, let me enjoy
some alone time in the bath.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.080
Hand it over.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:21.020
Shino, I am going to ask you again.

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:26.280
What precisely is your
relationship with Mr. Satomi?

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.030
It's a secret.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:32.790
For the record, it has absolutely
NOTHING to do with you.

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:35.170
Nothing at all?

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.100
Ah, er, I'm sorry.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.050
I met him five years ago.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.260
Five years ago?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.420
You and Hamaji probably don't remember,

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:52.060
but the guy who saved us from
the brink of death in Otsuka Village...

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.350
...was Satomi.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.810
Mr. Satomi saved our lives?

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.050
Yeah...

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.940
Will you continue to wait

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:16.710
for your life as a mere
person to draw to an end?

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:20.520
Or would you accept a monster into your body
so that you may survive?

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:23.590
Choose which fate you prefer.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:33.680
After that, I swore to Satomi
that I would repay the favor.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:36.730
So this doesn't concern you.

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:41.980
What was that for?!

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:45.990
That man made you choose
to accept Murasame?

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:55.500
He gave me an option other than "death".

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:58.420
All said and done, I didn't want to die.

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:03.000
Even if you are frozen
in time as a 13-year old?

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:06.010
It's not like my mind stopped aging!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.520
Well...

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:09.920
It's hard to say...

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:13.230
I bet you're thinkin' something
super rude, aren't you?!

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:15.160
I'm fine.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.770
I've got you and Hamaji.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:22.520
As long as I'm not alone,
I can handle any physical form. 'Kay?

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:25.550
Understood.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:28.860
In that case, tomorrow
let's ask Mr. Satomi

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:30.530
what he needed with us.

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.730
It's too late to ask him tonight.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:33.530
Yeah.

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:36.780
Good night.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:45.870
Someday, when Shino has been
left to live on his own,

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.380
will he be able to keep his sanity?

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.620
Those two certainly
stand out, don't they?

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.440
And here I needed to talk to Satomi.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.270
Apparently he is busy.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:12.050
Besides, isn't it nice to go sightseeing
around the Imperial Capital?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.810
It's them again!

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:19.330
They consider themselves
to be his bodyguards.

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:21.990
They're just making
themselves look suspicious.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:23.660
Shino!

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.590
Check it out!

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:26.630
Here!

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.590
It's the Imperial Capital's special delicacy,
cow liver ice cream.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:32.090
Is it yummy?

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:36.610
Shino!

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.100
What happened?

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.670
You know how Shino hates liver.

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:43.560
But it's ice cream! Even that's out?

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:47.430
I will have to buy some
for Rio as a souvenir.

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:53.610
Say what?! Why the hell
did you fire Genpachi?!

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:57.190
Genpachi Inukai has been on
unauthorized leave for over a week,

00:07:57.190 --> 00:08:00.120
despite being a Captain
in the military police.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.150
Furthermore, he is the central
figure in those rumors.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:06.000
It is natural for him to
be discharged. That is all.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:08.500
Hey, stop right there, ya old fart!

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:14.850
This feeling...!

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.510
Crap!

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.970
Not that kid from yesterday...!

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.510
Are you all right, Shino?

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.020
KONA-YA

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:24.020
Ma, you around?

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:25.590
Ma!

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.530
Silence, Kobungo!

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:33.230
How many times must I tell you
to call me "Head Innkeeper" in here?

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:35.620
Don't you realize that you
are disturbing our guests?

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:39.280
My! Are those guests as well?

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:42.030
No, we are-

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.790
What a handsome gentleman

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:46.790
and an adorable boy!

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:49.550
Uh, these are my pals.

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:53.050
I am Sosuke Inukawa and
this is Shino Inuzuka.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:55.330
My, what a coincidence!

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:59.340
Our last name is Inuta,
which has "Inu" in it as well.

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:01.990
Goodness, me! Are you all right?

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:05.340
That knot on your head is huge.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:09.660
H-Head Innkeeper, I'm sorry, but
could you serve these guys some grub?

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:11.810
Please come in.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.460
Gosh darn it!

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:17.700
Where did Shino and Sosuke wander off?

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:20.950
They may have gotten lost somewhere.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:24.440
But Shii isn't alone,
so he should be fine.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:26.370
It's not like I'm worried.

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:28.360
This is good!

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:29.780
Yeah, isn't this great?
This is good!

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:31.340
What an unusual flavor.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:33.960
They are students from a
nearby school for girls.

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:35.130
Okay.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.220
Sweet Buns filled with
Beef Liver Ice Cream

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:41.220
A school?

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.750
I'd like information on
some of the local schools.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:47.070
If the Church is involved,
your options will be limited.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:48.650
I don't mind.

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:52.350
Also, according to the rumors in town,

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:55.560
the Shogetsu Institute
has caught a demon.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.830
I feel sorry for the demon.

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:03.410
Of all people,
he had to get caught by him.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.830
You should keep a careful
watch over Murasame.

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:12.660
The Church isn't the only
group hungry for such power.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.690
Although I doubt they would ever dream

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:18.810
that it has taken on that form.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.390
That was delicious!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:24.010
Thanks for the feast, Kobungo.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.710
It was! You've got one massive appetite.

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:29.050
It must be tough feeding
a ravenous runt like him.

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:29.770
Hardly.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:33.020
But why do you keep gettin'
into fights every day?

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:36.280
It's that damn Shogetsu
Institute's fault.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:40.220
Shogetsu Institute?
You mean those monks from yesterday?

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:44.920
They've captured my
bro and locked him up.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:49.540
Sorry. This ain't the sort
of thing ya tell tourists.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.510
Do you recognize where you are now?

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:53.240
Y-yeah...

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:54.900
Then I'm off!

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:59.890
I'm sure he must have his reasons...

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:01.460
Yeah.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:05.680
Pardon me.

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:09.670
We need to have a word with you about-

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.690
I would like to skip
straight to the point.

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:16.440
Mr. Satomi, why exactly did you ask
Shino to come here?

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:25.950
DEVOTION
DUTY

00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:30.910
I thought we lost these!

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.330
DUTY

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:32.330
"Duty" belongs to Sosuke.

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:34.340
DEVOTION

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.320
And mine says "Devotion".

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:35.960
I've been looking for these for ages...

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:39.320
So you had them?

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:42.360
Hey, could you give these gems back?

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:45.370
We had them when we were kids.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:46.600
They mean a lot to us.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.600
There are six other
gems just like those.

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:54.360
What?! There are other people
with gems just like ours?

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:59.010
Those gems date back to Princess Fuse
and eight young men.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:00.310
Say what?

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:02.860
It's a legend passed
down the Satomi line.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:04.870
A legend?

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:10.570
CONTINENT
COUNTRY

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:08.970
Long ago, there was a
woman named Tamazusa

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.580
who came from the continent.

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:19.000
TAMAZUSA
BEAUTIFUL

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:14.440
That woman used her beauty
and silver tongue to deceive

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:16.210
and overthrow one person after the next

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.000
until she made her way
to the Imperial Palace.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:22.380
TURBULENT
AGE OF DARKNESS

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:21.980
After that, the Dark
Ages fell upon the land.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:25.960
FAMINE

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.250
The earth grew dry and
the people starved.

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:27.500
Murder ran rampant as the
country fell into turmoil.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:28.670
ROARING FLAMES
FIERCE WINDS

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:32.260
That is when a princess appeared,
accompanied by eight young men.

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:32.270
PRINCESS FUSE
(Hakkenshi)
EIGHT DOG WARRIORS

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:36.720
And then what?

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:40.470
You are the one who
asked to hear the story.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:44.530
It sounds like this is gonna drag out.
I totally regret ever asking.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:48.650
At any rate, there are
a total of eight gems.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:54.040
Find the remaining six and
their respective owners.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.410
Like that's even possible, Moron!

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:01.050
How many people do you think
are there in the world?

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.660
Put an ad in the newspaper
right this friggin' second!

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.960
If possible, I would like to
search for them in secret.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.930
That's freaking impossible!

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:11.010
Besides, that gem is the only thing

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:13.930
connecting Sosuke with his real parents.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.380
He can't give it to you.

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:18.940
So we just have to
find the gems' owners?

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:20.440
Sosuke?

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:22.440
That is correct.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:23.800
Very well.

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:27.450
Wha-? H-hey!

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:30.860
Sosuke!

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:33.280
Wait up!

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:34.280
Shino!

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:34.830
What now?

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:37.400
This is in regard to Sosuke.

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.190
Have you noticed anything different

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:44.840
What are you asking?

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:47.690
I am not referring to how
he can take Yoshiro's form.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:51.170
I am asking if something
else about him has changed.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:52.100
Not a thing!

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:54.350
It could simply be that
you have not noticed.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:55.920
I don't wanna hear it!

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:02.360
Even if he has changed,

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:03.860
DEVOTION
DUTY

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:06.060
Sosuke is still Sosuke, isn't he?

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:20.880
Father Seiran, I beg of you!
Please set Genpachi free!

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:23.880
He was supposed to wed my daughter.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:26.040
I think of him as a son!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.390
I am at a loss.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:32.900
I have heard that your daughter
took her life because of Genpachi.

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:35.890
It would be only natural
for you to hate him.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.920
In fact, wouldn't you
like to see him dead?

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.570
You are mistaken! Nui...

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:45.400
My child died in an
unfortunate accident.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:51.960
Genpachi and my family have worked
hard to overcome our grief.

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:54.220
It's taken time to come this far.

00:14:55.900 --> 00:15:00.240
Please give Genpachi
back! I beg it of you!

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:03.290
The creature we caught was a demon.

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:05.420
He is not your son.

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:07.520
See him out.

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:11.300
Father Seiran, please
wait! Father Seiran!

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:13.500
Father Seiran!

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:24.900
I thought you might have
reached your limit.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:27.900
O Demon, awaken!

00:15:58.710 --> 00:16:00.380
Hey, what is that?

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:02.470
Dang, check that out!

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:03.720
Is someone on the tower?

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:05.300
No, something seems off...

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:07.260
A demon! Isn't that a demon?

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:17.740
Can you still say in all
honesty that he isn't a demon?

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:23.120
Demon, devour as many evil spirits
as your heart desires!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.630
I can smell a spirit.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:33.630
Consume... I want to consume it!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:35.740
Where is it?

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:41.140
Wait up, Sosuke!

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:43.690
Are you seriously gonna do as he asked?

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:44.970
Yes.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:47.900
Then what're you gonna do
about your Gem of Duty?

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:51.060
I do not need it.

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:51.680
What?!

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:53.180
He is welcome to have it.

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:57.590
Did you say that this is
none of my concern so that

00:16:57.590 --> 00:16:59.900
you could conduct that strange
treasure hunt by yourself?

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:02.740
What of it? That gem
is important to you-

00:17:02.740 --> 00:17:06.790
Back then, I chose to
live together with you.

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.310
So I also have a say in the matter.

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:11.570
Isn't that right, Shino?

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:13.300
Y-yeah...

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:16.290
Would you like to grab
something to take home?

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:20.930
Shino?

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:22.380
Something is coming!

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:24.060
Shino!

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:26.060
Where are you?

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:29.260
What is that?

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:30.140
It's a demon!

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.070
There's a demon!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.070
I will devour you.

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:36.140
A demon?!

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:38.940
Is it that spirit-eating demon?

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:40.330
Makes sense.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:44.330
No wonder he'd go after me
when I'm so young and healthy.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:47.960
Shino?!

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:51.340
The people and buildings are in the way.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:55.590
I'll draw him outta town.
See ya later, Sosuke!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:56.710
Shino!

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:00.100
This game of tag is for real!

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.540
You've got some nerve,
thinking you could eat me!

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:04.600
You've gotta catch me
if ya wanna eat me!

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:20.940
Hey, look!

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:21.560
Someone's up there!

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:22.980
Isn't that a kid?
Someone's up there!

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:27.370
Bro?!

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:37.870
That demon smells strangely human...

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:44.430
Genpachi!

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:55.280
This oughta be far enough.

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:10.320
Are you a demon? Or a person?

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:16.790
Hunger...! I want to consume you!

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:18.920
He...

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:23.430
He just might be...

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:39.140
Nui?

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:50.000
This is Kobungo's...!

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:52.820
Shino! Are you all right?

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:55.570
Sosuke, that's a person.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.260
He isn't crying over what he's become.

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.110
He's continued to cry,
despite taking that form.

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.460
He isn't any different from us.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:14.760
What's that?

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:16.770
A large group of people are coming.

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:18.780
It's a demon hunt.

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:20.350
A demon hunt?

00:20:24.270 --> 00:20:26.900
What is that? A bug?

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:35.290
The evil spirit that
the demon went after...

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:38.450
I was wondering what it might be.

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:40.110
Now I see.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.300
So he went after Murasame.

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.520
No wonder my bugs are so excited.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:52.690
Brat, where, pray tell,
did you obtain that sword?

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:55.690
You callin' me a brat, damn monk?

00:20:56.590 --> 00:20:59.390
Those are some freaky bugs
you're toting around.

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:01.190
You're the monster here.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:04.270
I can see that you are an uncouth child.

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:08.940
Not that it matters.
You are hardly human anyway.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.430
Shoot them!

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:16.280
We'll hit the child.

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:17.580
Don't be fooled!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:22.090
A normal child could not possibly
maintain a smile given his situation.

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:22.990
Fire!

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:30.210
So! The river...!

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:30.810
Right!

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:32.180
Don't let him escape!

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:33.060
Shino!

00:21:50.360 --> 00:21:51.440
Sosuke!

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:41.050
Homecoming

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.830
Meat! Meat! I wanna eat yakiniku!

00:23:29.830 --> 00:23:31.830
Beef and pork
would break our budget.

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:32.880
But we could afford chicken.

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:35.230
Sweet! Yakitori! Yakitori!

00:23:34.590 --> 00:23:37.980
Murasame, sit still. This won't hurt.
